 
 
 

 
weather app   fastmcp  weather app  


 weather app tool weather forecast location  str  -  str f sunny skies location  today  


 weather app resource uri  weather   forecast weather data temperature   72   conditions    sunny    humidity   45   wind speed   5 


 
news app   fastmcp  news app  


 news app tool news headlines   -  list str tech company launches new product  
         local team wins championship  
         scientists make breakthrough discovery  
     


 news app resource uri  news   headlines news data top story    breaking news  important event happened  
         categories     politics    sports    technology   
         sources     ap    reuters    local sources   
     


 
app   fastmcp  main app  


 app tool check app status   -  dict str  str status    running    version    1 0 0    uptime    3h 24m  


 
app mount server weather app  namespace  weather  

app mount server news app  namespace  news server details   
     
     
    tools app list tools  
    print f \navailable tools   len tools tool tools 
        print f   -  tool name    tool description   

     
    print  \navailable resources   

     
     

    resources app list resources  

    native resources    
        str r uri r resources urlparse str r uri   netloc weather    news  
     

     
    weather resources    
        str r uri r resources urlparse str r uri   netloc     weather 
     
    news resources    
        str r uri r resources urlparse str r uri   netloc     news 
     

    print f   - native app resources   native resources   
    print f   - imported weather app   weather resources   
    print f   - imported news app   news resources name         main    
     
    asyncio run server details   

     
    app run  
  examples mount example